Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:28.50,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Step number one, well done.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第一步 干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:30.83,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}10{\fs68}日凌晨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.83,0:00:33.69,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}印第安韦尔斯年终总决赛小组赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.69,0:00:35.52,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}没能收下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:38.56,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}萨巴伦卡怎么拿回第二次机会？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.75,0:00:43.37,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}连续第六次来到年终总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.37,0:00:45.29,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}对手却并不好打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.29,0:00:48.25,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}赛前交手 穆霍娃{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.25,0:00:51.48,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}这一场 先看谁能守住机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.15,0:01:18.72,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}底线正反手拉锯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:21.69,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}首盘两次落后 她都立即回破
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.69,0:01:23.74,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}穆霍娃又救了两个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.74,0:01:25.96,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}把比赛带进抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:36.70,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the third time is indeed the charm for Sabalenka.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第三次机会 萨巴伦卡终于兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:39.30,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Her third set point earns her the opening set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第三个盘点 她拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.30,0:01:42.50,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It wasn't easy in 59 minutes against Karolina Muchova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N面对穆霍娃 这{\fs78}59{\fs68}分钟并不轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.50,0:01:45.70,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But the world number two has her first set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但世界第二还是先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:49.00,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And halfway to a victory in her opening match in Indian Wells.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N印第安韦尔斯首战 已赢半程
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.15,0:01:50.61,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}拿下抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.61,0:01:52.39,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}并不等于比赛结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.39,0:01:55.00,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}第二盘 双方连续{\fs78}3{\fs68}局互破
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:01:56.80,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}萨巴伦卡又带着优势
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.80,0:01:59.08,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}走向发球胜赛局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.15,0:02:04.10,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 第一次发球胜赛局没拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.10,0:02:06.27,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}穆霍娃追到了{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.27,0:02:09.76,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}萨巴伦卡要把机会 重新争回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:26.21,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}正手制胜 再次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.21,0:02:29.20,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}萨巴伦卡把比分带到{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:31.01,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}又一个发球胜赛局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.01,0:02:33.42,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}这一次能把胜利留下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:03:02.88,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Step number one, well done.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第一步 干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:10.88,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}One hour and 53 minutes to get past Karolina Muchova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N用时{\fs78}1{\fs68}小时{\fs78}53{\fs68}分钟 击败穆霍娃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:14.98,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}In what truly was a tussle in the California desert.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这的确是一场加州沙漠中的苦战
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.83,0:03:18.60,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}她来到网前 和穆霍娃拥抱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.60,0:03:20.69,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}刚才没能收下的那次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.69,0:03:22.52,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}终于有了答案
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.83,0:03:25.40,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.40,0:03:27.86,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}萨巴伦卡拿下小组首胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:29.62,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}下一场对安德烈娃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.62,0:03:33.07,TL,,0,0,376,,{\an2}她能把关键时刻的稳定延续下去吗？
